  "prefLabel": "En 912.01 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 912.01 Applicability. En 912 shall be applicable only to group hosts who select on-bill monetary credits for their members or who are required to select on-bill credits for their members, such as EAP LMI community solar project hosts and LMI community solar project hosts.\n\nSource. #14568, eff 4-27-26, EXPIRES: 4-27-36",
